  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together blueberries, granulated sugar, and cinnamon.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together flour, baking powder, and salt.",
    "Add unsalted butter and use a pastry blender to work it into the flour mixture.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs, milk, and vanilla extract.",
    "Pour the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Roll out the dough and place it over the blueberry mixture.",
    "Bake for 40-45 minutes, or until the crust is golden brown.",
    "Serve warm with vanilla ice cream."
